{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And Judah shall dwell forever</b> — If it does not rebel against the mouth of HaShem, and the Glory dwells in its midst, as he sealed his book. And every evil that the nations did to Israel, He will not avenge upon them, for His mercies are great over all His works. Only their blood, which they shed, for which there is no ransom — He will not clear."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:51.304098867Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}